{"id":"afe5ed5400a824d0","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Complement","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Complement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Complement","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-pointclass-closure-under-complement — ZFC Descriptive4 Pointclass Closure Under Complement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4da5e95c10688be\" href=\"?note=c4da5e95c10688be\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,D\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,D\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的元素为可测空间代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle X,\\Sigma\\rangle\">\\(\\langle X,\\Sigma\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4da5e95c10688be\" href=\"?note=c4da5e95c10688be\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-pointclass.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderComplement}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderComplement}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}pointclass\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderComplement}_S(\\Gamma,D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S(\\Gamma,D)\\land\n\\forall d\\in D\\;\\forall X,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(d=\\langle X,\\Sigma\\rangle\\to\\forall A\\in\\Gamma(d)\\;\n(X\\setminus A\\in\\Gamma(d))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}pointclass\\text{-}closure\\text{-}under\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4PointclassClosureUnderComplement}_S(\\Gamma,D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2Pointclass}_S(\\Gamma,D)\\land\n\\forall d\\in D\\;\\forall X,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(d=\\langle X,\\Sigma\\rangle\\to\\forall A\\in\\Gamma(d)\\;\n(X\\setminus A\\in\\Gamma(d))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>取补集的载体是空间代码的第一分量 X，而不是代码本身；pointclass 的函数实参仍为完整空间代码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targ